    <div class="container about-section">
        <div class="row align-items-center">
            <!-- Left Image Column -->
            <!-- Right Text Column -->
            <div class="col-md-12 about-content">
                <h2 class="about-heading">ABOUT REC PRATAPGARH</h2>
                <p class="about-text">
                    In order to expand the reach of quality technical education in the State of Uttar Pradesh, the government has decided to establish the engineering colleges in the districts of Basti, Gonda, Mirzapur, and Pratapgarh. As part of this initiative, Department of Technical Education, Government of Uttar Pradesh, through Office Memorandum No. 2053/16-1-2023-14(54)/2014, Lucknow, dated: August 2, 2023, has granted approval for the commencement of the Bharat Ratna Babasaheb Bhimrao Ambedkar Rajkiya Engineering College in the district of Pratapgarh from the academic session 2023–24.
                </p>
                <p class="about-text">
                    In accordance with this decision, the Bharat Ratna Babasaheb Bhimrao Ambedkar Rajkiya Engineering College, Pratapgarh is a state-funded government engineering college and presently affiliated with Dr. A.P.J. Abdul Kalam Technical University, Lucknow. The construction of the college is underway, therefore administrative and academic activities are presently conducted at Kamla Nehru Institute of Technology, Sultanpur.
                </p>
                <p class="about-text">
                    As per the decision of the state government, Bharat Ratna Babasaheb Bhimrao Ambedkar Rajkiya Engineering College, Pratapgarh will be operated from its own campus from the academic session 2025-26. The construction work of the college along with other infrastructural developments, is in full swing and to be completed very soon. Following the completion of construction and the development of necessary infrastructure, the college will be operated as a fully functional government engineering college, in line with other state-run technical institutions in Uttar Pradesh. [<a href="~/Content/REC Files/GO.pdf" target="_blank" style="text-decoration:underline">GO Attached</a>]
                </p>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Bottom Paragraph -->
        
    </div>

</div>
<div class="container mb-5" style="margin-top:-70px;">
    <div class="row">
        <div class="col-sm-12">
            <h1 class="about-heading">VISION</h1>
            <p class="about-text">
                To become a nationally recognized College of engineering and technological education that fosters innovation, interdisciplinary research, and societal impact. The institute aspires to nurture globally competent engineers equipped with cutting-edge skills in emerging technologies like Artificial Intelligence, Machine Learning, Smart Systems and interdisciplinary engineering while upholding values of integrity, inclusiveness, and service to the nation.
            </p>
            <h1 class="about-heading">MISSION</h1>
            <ol class="about-text">
                <li>
                    Academic Excellence
                    To provide high-quality, future-ready engineering education in CSE, EE, ME, and CE through modern pedagogy, experiential learning, inspired mentorship and continuous curriculum innovation.
                </li>
                <li>
                    Foster Research and Innovation
                    To promote a culture of applied research and innovation with a strong focus on AI, healthcare technologies, sustainable development, and smart infrastructure.
                </li>
                <li>
                    Build Strategic Industry & Academic Linkages
                    To foster academic and industry collaborations that enhance research capabilities, entrepreneurship, and hands-on learning, ensuring graduates are future-ready.

                </li>
                <li>
                    Student-Centric Development
                    To cultivate a dynamic, inclusive, and value-driven learning environment that nurtures creativity, leadership, communication, and ethical responsibility among students.

                </li>
                <li>Societal Impact To actively contribute to regional progress and national missions through technology-driven solutions in agriculture, healthcare, education, and public infrastructure.</li>
            </ol>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>
</div>